{%- comment -%}
  Phosphor Regular icon, inline (the only icon family in Facet).
  The CSS adds a 3.2 stroke on the 256 viewBox so the line reads 1.5px at 20px.

  Accepts:
  - icon {String} Phosphor name, e.g. 'caret-right'
  - size {Number} pixel size (default 20)
  - class {String} extra classes

  Usage: {% render 'icon', icon: 'caret-right', size: 12 %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="dl-icon{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" width="{{ size | default: 20 }}" height="{{ size | default: 20 }}" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
